1-00-7-3JHPFTNV.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<p>The two-pointer pattern is very versatile and, consequently, quite broad=
. As such, we want to cover more specialized variants of this algorithm in =
separate chapters, such as <em>Fast and Slow Pointers</em> and <em>Sliding =
